## Full automation roadmap (future)

| Phase | Owner | Action |
|-------|--------|--------|
| 1 Intake | Cloud Run | Weekday scan → GCS ✓ |
| 2 Sync | Local cron / Cursor Automation | `sync_gcs_inbox.py` |
| 3 Triage | This agent | `inbox/_state/processed.json` by `message_id` |
| 4 Generate | **New JDs agent** | Score + `applications/{slug}/` from inbox JSON |
| 5 Draft | This agent | `draft_all_recruiter_replies.py` (draft only) |
| 6 Approve | Cary | Review in Gmail; send manually |

Use **Cursor Automation** for phase 4 (weekday), not cloud LLM — keeps `.prompt` tailoring quality. Cloud stays readonly scan only.

---

## Safety & approval gates

| Action | Rule |
|--------|------|
| `draft_all_recruiter_replies.py --send` | Only if user explicitly asks to send |
| Generate &lt;80% match | Report only; do not generate unless user asks |
| Git commit | Never unless user asks |

