```
Google protocol — 2026-08-04

Cloud: recruiter-scan executed — 3 new in GCS; synced 12 files locally
Local scan: 2 new inbox JSON saved

GENERATED
  honor (87%) — applications/honor/ — draft created (gmail_draft_id: r…)

DRAFTS
  Created: honor, nextera
  Skipped: tillster — Indeed noreply (use apply_url)

SKIPPED (inbox)
  java-backend-acme (72%) — Java/Spring primary stack gap

PENDING YOU
  Review Gmail drafts; send manually when ready
  nextera — apply via Greenhouse URL in meta.json
```

