## Boundaries

| Agent | Owns |
|-------|------|
| **Google protocol** (this) | Scan, sync, parse inbox, link `source_email`, initial drafts, Cloud deploy |
| **New JDs** (root `.prompt`) | Match score, tailor HTML, styling, interview prep |
| **LinkedIn protocol** (`tools/linkedin/.prompt`) | MCP search/fetch, Easy Apply, initial InMail |
| **Response protocol** (`tools/response/.prompt`) | Follow-ups after apply — Gmail + LinkedIn inbound |

When user pastes a recruiter email here: extract JD → hand off to New JDs for tailoring, or draft only if application exists.

When user asks to check responses after applying: use **Response protocol** (`tools/response/.prompt`).
